{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"水文学导论：水量平衡与滞留时间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/intro-and-core-concepts","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"水文学导论-水量平衡与滞留时间\">水文学导论：水量平衡与滞留时间</h1><p>把整个地球的水想象成一个银行账户：太阳能是发动机，蒸发是取款，降水是存款，而河流、冰川、地下水则是余额停留在不同账户里的形态。水文学（hydrology）研究的，正是这笔水账在时间和空间上如何收支、如何分布、如何运动。它既是一门描述自然规律的地球科学，也是一门为防洪、供水、灌溉、生态服务的工程科学。本篇为整个 hub 搭建两块基石：贯穿始终的水量平衡方程，以及解释「水更新有多快」的滞留时间概念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>水文学的研究对象可以收敛为一句话：水在地球各圈层之间的储存与通量。储存量（storage）是某一时刻待在某个水库里的水，比如某流域土壤中的含水量；通量（flux）是单位时间穿过某个界面的水，比如年降水量。整个水文循环就是由若干储存库和连接它们的通量组成的网络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;海洋&lt;br/&gt;储量约 96.5%&quot;] --&gt;|蒸发| B[&quot;大气水汽&lt;br/&gt;滞留约 9 天&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|降水| C[&quot;陆地表面&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|地表径流| D[&quot;河流湖泊&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|下渗| E[&quot;地下水含水层&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|蒸散发| B&#10;  E --&gt;|基流补给| D&#10;  D --&gt;|入海径流| A&#10;  E --&gt;|海底排泄| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"海洋&lt;br/&gt;储量约 96.5%\"] --&gt;|蒸发| B[\"大气水汽&lt;br/&gt;滞留约 9 天\"]\n  B --&gt;|降水| C[\"陆地表面\"]\n  C --&gt;|地表径流| D[\"河流湖泊\"]\n  C --&gt;|下渗| E[\"地下水含水层\"]\n  C --&gt;|蒸散发| B\n  E --&gt;|基流补给| D\n  D --&gt;|入海径流| A\n  E --&gt;|海底排泄| A</pre><p>地球总水量约 13.86 亿立方千米，但分布极不均衡。下表给出各主要储存库的占比与典型更新速度，凸显「总量巨大、可用极少、更新极慢」这一水文学的基本张力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>储存库</th>\n<th>占全球水量比例</th>\n<th>典型滞留时间</th>\n<th>对人类的可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海洋</td>\n<td>约 96.5%</td>\n<td>约 3200 年</td>\n<td>需淡化，成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰川与永久积雪</td>\n<td>约 1.7%</td>\n<td>数百至上万年</td>\n<td>季节性融水可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地下水</td>\n<td>约 1.7%</td>\n<td>数天至数万年</td>\n<td>主力淡水来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>湖泊与河流</td>\n<td>约 0.013%</td>\n<td>河流约 16 天</td>\n<td>最易取用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气水汽</td>\n<td>约 0.001%</td>\n<td>约 9 天</td>\n<td>不直接取用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"水量平衡方程-全-hub-的记账框架\">水量平衡方程：全 hub 的记账框架</h2><p>水量平衡（water balance）是水文学的「守恒律」，本质是质量守恒在水文系统上的应用。对任意空间单元和任意时段，输入减去输出等于储量变化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = ET + Q + \\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是降水，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ET</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是蒸散发，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是径流（流出减流入的净值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是该时段内储水量的变化。这个方程看似简单，却是后面所有定量分析的母方程：水资源评价用它算可利用量，洪水计算用它推产流，气候变化研究用它诊断循环加速。</p>\n<p>方程的强大之处在于尺度无关：它对一个花盆、一块农田、一个流域乃至全球都成立，只是各项的取值与可测性不同。在长时段平均（如多年平均）下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 趋近于零，方程简化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx ET + Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，这正是估算流域产水量的经典出发点。各分量的物理机理将在 <a href=\"precipitation-evaporation-infiltration\">降水、蒸发与下渗</a> 中逐一展开，而径流项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的产生与汇聚则是 <a href=\"runoff-watershed\">径流与流域</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，方程中难测的往往是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ET</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。地下储水量变化过去几乎无法直接观测，直到 GRACE 重力卫星出现才有了从太空称量的手段——这一突破将在 <a href=\"../frontiers-challenges/smart-water-remote-sensing\">智慧水务与遥感</a> 中详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滞留时间-水更新有多快\">滞留时间：水更新有多快</h2><p>滞留时间（residence time，又称更新周期）回答的是「一个储存库里的水平均要待多久才被换掉一遍」。它定义为储量除以通量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r = \\frac{S}{Q_{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是库内储量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是流出通量。以大气为例，全球大气水汽储量约 12900 立方千米，全球年降水量约 505000 立方千米，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>12900</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>505000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>365</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r \\approx 12900 / 505000 \\times 365 \\approx 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12900/505000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 天——这就是为什么天气预报只能看几天、而一场暴雨的水汽几天前可能还在远方的海面上。</p>\n<p>滞留时间的意义远超数字本身。它决定了污染物在水体中的停留与稀释速度：河流滞留时间短，污染冲走得快但也扩散得快；深层地下水滞留时间动辄上万年，一旦被污染几乎不可逆，这也是地下水保护比地表水更严苛的根本原因，相关水质机理见 <a href=\"../surface-groundwater/water-quality-ecology\">水质与水生态</a>。它还决定了系统对扰动的「记忆」长度：冰川对气候变化的响应滞后于大气，正是因为其滞留时间极长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"水文学的研究方法与现代演进\">水文学的研究方法与现代演进</h2><p>传统水文学建立在三类方法上：实测（建站观测降水、水位、流量）、统计（用历史序列推断频率与重现期）、物理建模（用方程模拟产汇流过程）。这三类方法至今仍是骨架，但其形态已被现代技术深刻改写。</p>\n<p>实测从稀疏的地面站点扩展到了卫星与雷达的面状覆盖；统计的前提——平稳性（stationarity，即统计特征不随时间变化）正在气候变化下动摇，传统重现期的含义被迫重新审视，这一争议见 <a href=\"../water-resources-management/floods-droughts\">防洪与干旱</a> 与 <a href=\"../frontiers-challenges/climate-change-water\">气候变化与水</a>；物理建模则与机器学习融合，催生了数据驱动与机理混合的新一代水文模型。</p>\n<p>水文学的边界也在外扩：它向上对接气象与气候科学，向下连接地下水力学与水化学，向外延伸到水资源管理、生态学与社会科学。理解这一点很重要——本 hub 后续章节看似分属不同领域，实则都站在本篇这套「储量—通量—平衡—滞留」的统一语言之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本篇的概念骨架可归纳如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((水文学基石))&#10;    储量与通量&#10;      储存库&#10;      通量界面&#10;    水量平衡&#10;      P=ET+Q+ΔS&#10;      尺度无关&#10;    滞留时间&#10;      Tr=S/Qout&#10;      决定污染停留&#10;    研究方法&#10;      实测&#10;      统计&#10;      物理建模\">mindmap\n  root((水文学基石))\n    储量与通量\n      储存库\n      通量界面\n    水量平衡\n      P=ET+Q+ΔS\n      尺度无关\n    滞留时间\n      Tr=S/Qout\n      决定污染停留\n    研究方法\n      实测\n      统计\n      物理建模</pre><ul>\n<li>水文学研究水在地球各圈层的储存与通量，核心张力是「总量巨大、可用极少、更新速度悬殊」。</li>\n<li>水量平衡方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = ET + Q + \\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是质量守恒的水文表达，尺度无关，是全 hub 一切定量分析的母方程；长时段平均下简化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx ET + Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>滞留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r = S/Q_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量水的更新速度，从大气的约 9 天到深层地下水的上万年不等，决定了污染物停留、系统记忆与保护策略。</li>\n<li>难测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ET</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 长期是水文学的痛点，遥感（如 GRACE）正在改变这一局面。</li>\n<li>传统的实测—统计—物理建模三大方法仍是骨架，但平稳性假设的动摇与机器学习的引入正重塑这门学科，后续各篇都建立在本篇的统一语言之上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水文学导论：水量平衡与滞留时间","id":"水文学导论-水量平衡与滞留时间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"水量平衡方程：全 hub 的记账框架","id":"水量平衡方程-全-hub-的记账框架"},{"level":2,"text":"滞留时间：水更新有多快","id":"滞留时间-水更新有多快"},{"level":2,"text":"水文学的研究方法与现代演进","id":"水文学的研究方法与现代演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"降水、蒸发与下渗：水循环的三个垂向分量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/precipitation-evaporation-infiltration"}}